!-   ===========  ENTRANCE CANOPY (ADDED) ===========
! West-facade patient drop-off canopy at the Floor 1 vestibule/lobby entrance.
! Same projection as the hospital prototype (HOSP6): 12 ft (3.658 m) at 10 ft (3.048 m).
! Covers the west vestibule door (84A1D5) and the west lobby door/window (F67E1F, AAE778).
! Opaque (no transmittance schedule). Vertices counterclockwise from above.
